{
	"name": "Demolition Assisted Entry",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/fire/barrier-shield-explosion-yellow.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As an action, you may attempt to blast a door or gate open with a powerful burst of magic. Make an Arcana check using your spellcasting modifier against the DC of the door’s lock, the DC to break the door with a Strength ability check, or the DC to push away any object on the far side of the door, whichever is highest. On a successful check, you blast the door off it’s hinges, destroying it in a cacophanous blast that can easily be heard for 300ft in all directions. Anything pressed against the door on the far side is knocked back 10ft, and creatures knocked in such a way can make a Dexterity save against your spell save DC to avoid being knocked [[/condition id=prone]].</p>",
